<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Everything your team needs to add Rallybit, configure checks, automate recurring prompts, and understand participation."><title>Documentation — Rallybit Docs</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/docs/style.css?v=6.2"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/brand/rallybit-icon-32.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/assets/brand/rallybit-icon-192.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/brand/apple-touch-icon.png"></head><body><div class="docs-shell"><div data-doc-sidebar></div><main class="docs-main"><span class="eyebrow">Documentation</span><h1>Run better activity checks.</h1><p class="lead">Everything your team needs to add Rallybit, configure checks, automate recurring prompts, and understand participation.</p><div class="docs-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="setup.html">Start setup</a><a class="btn" href="commands.html">Browse commands</a></div><div class="callout"><strong>Every feature is included.</strong><span>Automation, custom buttons, logs, profiles, leaderboards, and analytics are available to every connected server.</span></div><h2>Choose a guide</h2><div class="card-grid"><a class="doc-card" href="setup.html" data-searchable><h3>Set up Rallybit</h3><p>Invite the bot, confirm permissions, and launch your first check.</p></a><a class="doc-card" href="features.html" data-searchable><h3>Explore features</h3><p>Learn how automation, logs, profiles, and analytics fit together.</p></a><a class="doc-card" href="commands.html" data-searchable><h3>Command reference</h3><p>See every main slash command and what it changes.</p></a><a class="doc-card" href="faq.html" data-searchable><h3>Troubleshooting</h3><p>Fix missing responses, permissions, schedules, and dashboard access.</p></a></div><h2>Recommended workflow</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step" data-searchable><div><h3>Configure the basics</h3><p>Set the activity message, response method, duration, and staff role.</p></div></div><div class="step" data-searchable><div><h3>Run one manual check</h3><p>Confirm that members can respond and the result appears in your logs.</p></div></div><div class="step" data-searchable><div><h3>Enable automation</h3><p>Pick a channel and interval once the manual flow works as expected.</p></div></div></div></main></div><script src="/docs/script.js?v=5.0"></script></body></html>